      "writtenOn": "2022-05-20T23:31:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another way is to block CC_EVENTS print when initial debug is done, see in board.h:\n```\n/*\n * By default, enable all console messages excepted HC, ACPI and event:\n * The sensor stack is generating a lot of activity.\n */\n#define CC_DEFAULT     (CC_ALL \u0026 ~(CC_MASK(CC_EVENTS) | CC_MASK(CC_LPC)))\n#undef CONFIG_HOSTCMD_DEBUG_MODE\n#define CONFIG_HOSTCMD_DEBUG_MODE HCDEBUG_OFF\n```",
      "revId": "44e23350f62e4c3a030b4e277d37bbca8b157d32",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
