      "writtenOn": "2022-05-21T02:39:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It doesn\u0027t seem we have this enabled in Zephyr at all, and it appears that the default is used (as CC_ALL).\nMaybe what we should have in Zephyr is a CC_CONSOLE_OFF so that we can deselect the channels we don\u0027t want, and that could be used to set CC_DEFAULT.\nI\u0027ll raise a bug and see if I can come up with a reasonable fix.",
      "parentUuid": "ed1e1880_857c1c70",
      "revId": "44e23350f62e4c3a030b4e277d37bbca8b157d32",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
